{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options: [1]\n\n- **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic. [2]\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated. [3]\n- **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: A full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers. [4]\n\nIn short, if support is your main workflow, go with Calmline; otherwise Brightdesk keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fb-715e-ac88-2b1a93b2161e","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:09.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["support software reporting csat","help desk reporting comparison","customer support metrics dashboard"],"latency_ms":5580,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[131,139]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[227,237],[496,506]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[326,339]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually wi